  "body": "During the TPAC session, the question came up of whether cross-origin iframes should be able to call `requestDevice` or communicate with devices they already have access to. See @torgo's https://github.com/w3ctag/spec-reviews/issues/90. I believe the current Chromium implementation completely forbids access from iframes, but we should figure out if that's the right thing to specify.\n",
